# W9-T2 counter differential golden (value-level parity with gen_ngram).
#
# The Rust counter (`oxpinyin-counter`) is run over `segmenter-ngseg.txt`
# (T1's output) with the pinned model20 phrase index as the freq-1 floor
# seed. The full value dump is ~1.5 MB of integer counts, so instead of
# tracking it we pin its exact shape and a dependency-free FNV-1a 64-bit
# checksum. `fnv1a64` is the hash of `Counts::dump()` — `\data
# pinyin-counter` / `\1-gram` / `\2-gram` / `\end`, one `token count` or
# `prev cur count` per line, sorted.
unigrams 138096
bigrams 199
fnv1a64 1f7af24b04577d8b
